# cards: a recharge stops at the card's full value (docs/plan-cards.md 2.6, point 7). As test_card_recharge, with
# the Bealzebub card (227) at 800 of its 900 points (0x020B489A). Expect: after the win (three Bealzebubs killed)
# its points are 900, not 1100, and the count stays 1. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213ba12 1
poke u16 0x020b489a 800
wait 270
watch u8 0x0213ba12 bealzebub_cards
watch u16 0x020b489a bealzebub_points
watch u8 0x0213ba25 thanatos_cards
watch u16 0x020b48c0 thanatos_points
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
